{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":48926,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d46bc1dd5d5b6fc5dffa7dd6bc51475b","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Boo&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I love the make up job that he does but I am worried about the hair. Does he use the same person each time? to me it seems like its easier to screw up the hair than it does the make up. By chance do any of you ladies know whether he would just do the make up?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n Fernando only does make-up. He brings someone else for the hair. The hair stylist he brought to do my hair is called Gama. I think that&#039;s his main hair guy, but for my wedding he brought another hair stylist because I had two girls who wanted to do their hair and we didn&#039;t have enough time for just one person to do everyone&#039;s hair. \n \n You don&#039;t have to do your hair if you don&#039;t want to. Are you having a trial done? I would really recommend it for the hair...that way you could feel more comfortable.","Attachments":[],"Id":1139847,"PostDate":1273106463,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Boo<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I love the make up job that he does but I am worried about the hair. Does he use the same person each time? to me it seems like its easier to screw up the hair than it does the make up. By chance do any of you ladies know whether he would just do the make up?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> Fernando only does make-up. He brings someone else for the hair. The hair stylist he brought to do my hair is called Gama. I think that's his main hair guy, but for my wedding he brought another hair stylist because I had two girls who wanted to do their hair and we didn't have enough time for just one person to do everyone's hair. <br \/> <br \/> You don't have to do your hair if you don't want to. Are you having a trial done? I would really recommend it for the hair...that way you could feel more comfortable.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.destination-wedding-guide.com\">The Destination Wedding Guide - Planning Tips & Ideas<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cynthia554@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"69.115.245.156","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1252953609,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221620.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"simba1234","Id":221620,"Name":"simba1234","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":48926,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b25ebc32430b07f175e2e4b903885c89","RawContent":"Thanks for the recommendation!","Attachments":[],"Id":1140029,"PostDate":1273115453,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the recommendation!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wongrose@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1264127439,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224931.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rosieposie","Id":224931,"Name":"rosieposie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":48926,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"08c02bb9c3bcfc9599441ea6d0484c12","RawContent":"I love to see pics too! Thanks for the info!","Attachments":[],"Id":1140069,"PostDate":1273118139,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n           