    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yes please share pics when you can, he sounds like just what I've been looking for!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tylergoo@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1273246840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227977.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pinky","Id":227977,"Name":"Pinky","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":48926,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9676ca4544d2e17421f3d8803eac7766","RawContent":"I&#039;m using Fernando as well. Any pictures you have would be greatly appreciated! Along with any information about his hair person.\n \n Also, how long did it take him to do your make-up? Did you all bring your own makeup?\n \n Thanks girls!","Attachments":[],"Id":1161280,"PostDate":1274747007,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm using Fernando as well. Any pictures you have would be greatly appreciated! Along with any information about his hair person.<br \/> <br \/> Also, how long did it take him to do your make-up? Did you all bring your own makeup?<br \/> <br \/> Thanks girls!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>~The future Mrs. Thompson~<\/strong><span>10*10*10<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mosier24@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1247701812,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219470.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RunningBride24","Id":219470,"Name":"RunningBride24","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":48926,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d37e958de2a5f38747d61420cdc886a","RawContent":"I am using him as well :) I love to hear great reviews \n \n RunningBride - he uses all mac make up and brings it with him, my question is though I wonder if he leave the make up with you for touch ups for later?\n \n I am having 6 bride maids get their and make done plus me, we have to be ready by 2:30 and he said he will start at 11:30 just to give you an idea of time","Attachments":[],"Id":1161462,"PostDate":1274756055,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am using him as well <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I love to hear great reviews <br \/> <br \/> RunningBride - he uses all mac make up and brings it with him, my question is though I wonder if he leave the make up with you for touch ups for later?<br \/> <br \/> I am having 6 bride maids get their and make done plus me, we have to be ready by 2:30 and he said he will start at 11:30 just to give you an idea of time\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>The Royal PDC & Kool Beach Club 11.12.10<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jesmcan@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1243390933,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217842.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jesmcan","Id":217842,"Name":"jesmcan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":48926,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aad369b34d0d06d1cb06f934ac9dc7c6","RawContent":"question for those who are having a trial with Fernando prior to their wedding day...when he comes to the hotel for the trial do you pay a vendor fee or a guest pass for him and the hair person? or does anyone know if he has a place near by to do the trial to avoid any additional fees? thanks in advance!","Attachments":[],"Id":1161494,"PostDate":1274758151,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                question for those who are having a trial with Fernando prior to their wedding day...when he comes to the hotel for the trial do you pay a vendor fee or a guest pass for him and the hair person? or does anyone know if he has a place near by to do the trial to avoid any additional fees? thanks in advance!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karbasetti@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1255745233,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222660.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":95,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"giraffexx","Id":222660,"Name":"giraffexx","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":48926,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3c6b26482a0182c8715b33df17338014","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;giraffexx&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;question for those who are having a trial with Fernando prior to their wedding day...when he comes to the hotel for the trial do you pay a vendor fee or a guest pass for him and the hair person? or does anyone know if he has a place near by to do the trial to avoid any additional fees? thanks in advance!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Well there are two answers for this one according to the royal lol as usual. One being yes you have to pay the vendor fee for him. Or no you don&#039;t if hes only going to come three and half hours before your wedding. No he does not have a near by location he has to come to the resort. I know the fees just suck after already paying so much money.","Attachments":[],"Id":1161544,"PostDate":1274759856,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>giraffexx<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">question for those who are having a trial with Fernando prior to their wedding day...when he comes to the hotel for the trial do you pay a vendor fee or a guest pass for him and the hair person? or does anyone know if he has a place near by to do the trial to avoid any additional fees? thanks in advance!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Well there are two answers for this one according to the royal lol as usual. One being yes you have to pay the vendor fee for him. Or no you don't if hes only going to come three and half hours before your wedding. No he does not have a near by location he has to come to the resort. I know the fees just suck after already paying so much money.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>The Royal PDC & Kool Beach Club 11.12.10<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jesmcan@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1243390933,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217842.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jesmcan","Id":217842,"Name":"jesmcan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":48926,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db23633713c94830a171342a9cff75e0","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;jesmcan&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Well there are two answers for this one according to the royal lol as usual. One being yes you have to pay the vendor fee for him. Or no you don&#039;t if hes only going to come three and half hours before your wedding. No he does not have a near by location he has to come to the resort. I know the fees just suck after already paying so much money.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks! That&#039;s what I kind of figured...more fees &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; Thank god my contract has the $100.00 vendor fee.","Attachments":[],"Id":1161561,"PostDate":1274760441,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>jesmcan<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Well there are two answers for this one according to the royal lol as usual. One being yes you have to pay the vendor fee for him. Or no you don't if hes only going to come three and half hours before your wedding. No he does not have a near by location he has to come to the resort. I know the fees just suck after already paying so much money.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks! That's what I kind of figured...more fees <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> Thank god my contract has the $100.00 vendor fee.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karbasetti@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1255745233,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222660.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":95,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"giraffexx","Id":222660,"Name":"giraffexx","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":48926,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d81f591693130343b533989c2297ce0","RawContent":"I loved working with Fernando! Gama did hair for me, my 4 bridesmaids plus my mom. Originally, only I was going to get my make up done by Fernando, but he ended up generously putting on false eyelashes for all the girls as well, and in addition did my sister&#039;s eye make up at the last minute. He is great under pressure as we were running out of time (because we started late, we were supposed to start around 1 for a 5pm ceremony, ended up starting around 2ish). He is super responsive to emails and traveled all the way from Cancun to Tulum for our wedding with no added travel fees. Fernando is super professional, but also fun and friendly as well. I would highly recommend him.","Attachments":[],"Id":1161586,"PostDate":1274763249,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I loved working with Fernando! Gama did hair for me, my 4 bridesmaids plus my mom. Originally, only I was going to get my make up done by Fernando, but he ended up generously putting on false eyelashes for all the girls as well, and in addition did my sister's eye make up at the last minute. He is great under pressure as we were running out of time (because we started late, we were supposed to start around 1 for a 5pm ceremony, ended up starting around 2ish). He is super responsive to emails and traveled all the way from Cancun to Tulum for our wedding with no added travel fees. Fernando is super professional, but also fun and friendly as well. I would highly recommend him.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Our Del Sol Wedding Pictures!<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/our-la-zebra-tulum-wedding-pictures-del-sol-photography-59273\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...ography-59273\/<\/a><br><br><span>My La Zebra Tulum Planning Thread<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/sita-nates-planning-thread-la-zebra-tulum-wedding-57763\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...wedding-57763\/<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i915.photobucket.com\/albums\/ac352\/Sita-Nate\/Wedding%20Pictures\/delsol.jpg\">http:\/\/i915.photobucket.com\/albums\/a...res\/delsol.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sitabita@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1240607878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217025.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sita&Nate","Id":217025,"Name":"Sita&Nate","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":52,"TotalPages":6,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":50},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
