{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.210.150.55","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"48d289bb9bb788640d1d543ed530437c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;After several months and going through way to many resorts we have FINALLY decided, booked, down payments made, rooms blocked, etc at NOW sapphire riviera cancun for our wedding March 12, 2016!!!! I would love ANY tips and recommendations for this resort or any general tips that you wish someone would have told you! We are getting ready to send out invites even though the people who we really wanted\/actually will attend already have all the wedding info. Do you have any recommendations for invites? we are NOT having an at home reception! any DJ recommendations? what did you DIY for your wedding and are you glad you did? How did you save money? did you do guests bags? what were in them? did you do any \"group\" activities with all your guests as a welcome type thing to get everyone excited\/to loosen up?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905808,"PostDate":1443759087,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>After several months and going through way to many resorts we have FINALLY decided, booked, down payments made, rooms blocked, etc at NOW sapphire riviera cancun for our wedding March 12, 2016!!!! I would love ANY tips and recommendations for this resort or any general tips that you wish someone would have told you! We are getting ready to send out invites even though the people who we really wanted\/actually will attend already have all the wedding info. Do you have any recommendations for invites? we are NOT having an at home reception! any DJ recommendations? what did you DIY for your wedding and are you glad you did? How did you save money? did you do guests bags? what were in them? did you do any \"group\" activities with all your guests as a welcome type thing to get everyone excited\/to loosen up?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kaitlyncrossley@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.210.150.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436615048,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283914.jpg?_r=1440103647","PhotoWidth":188,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Kaitlyncrossley","Id":283914,"Name":"Kaitlyncrossley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.179.168.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"774be2b83ba1c7d197444f4c2e09af5d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats Kaitlyn!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I hope you are having Juan Carlos as your WC, he is super professional.!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Puerto Morelos, where is located your resort, has a big big reef, and the dept of this is almost 50cm or 2 feet to 6 feet 2 meters. yes you need to reach the reef by boat that you can take in the town, that is 20 minutes by bike.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Snorkeling would be great as an activity for your guests.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Gonzalo&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905832,"PostDate":1443798612,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats Kaitlyn!!<\/p>\n<p>I hope you are having Juan Carlos as your WC, he is super professional.!<\/p>\n<p>Puerto Morelos, where is located your resort, has a big big reef, and the dept of this is almost 50cm or 2 feet to 6 feet 2 meters. yes you need to reach the reef by boat that you can take in the town, that is 20 minutes by bike.<\/p>\n<p>Snorkeling would be great as an activity for your guests.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>good luck!<\/p>\n<p>Gonzalo<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/BDW\/firma.jpg\" alt=\"firma.jpg\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Gonzalo Nunez - WEDDING PHOTOGRAPHER - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com'>www.gonzalonunez.com<\/a> - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/GonzaloNunezWeddingPhotographer'>Facebook Fanpage<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Tulum, Riviera Maya, Mexico, rest of the world.","Email":"info@gonzalonunez.com","IpAddress":"187.179.168.180","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1282081879,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231467.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gonzaloNunez","Id":231467,"Name":"gonzaloNunez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.166.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"995773ca6902290568b0cc3e700fe990","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community Kaitlyncrossley, and Congrats on your upcoming NOW Sapphire wedding - And having finalized your resort choice !!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ve chosen well - and will have a gorgeous backdrop for your wedding images - as you can see in these magical wedding moments that matter we captured there......great choice!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152285887359487.1073741881.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;NOW Sapphire Wedding Album 1:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10012197_10152285889364487_524506458_o.jpg\" alt=\"10012197_10152285889364487_524506458_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/1559314_10152285890684487_253307493_o.jpg\" alt=\"1559314_10152285890684487_253307493_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/1909431_10152285892349487_154319466_o.jpg\" alt=\"1909431_10152285892349487_154319466_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151784774734487.1073741863.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;NOW Sapphire Wedding Album 2:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash2\/t31.0-8\/1149436_10151784776474487_1878076495_o.jpg\" alt=\"1149436_10151784776474487_1878076495_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/l\/t31.0-8\/1270475_10151784779319487_2126711578_o.jpg\" alt=\"1270475_10151784779319487_2126711578_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;WIshing you happy reserach, and that your thoroughly ENJOY your amazing journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905837,"PostDate":1443802981,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community Kaitlyncrossley, and Congrats on your upcoming NOW Sapphire wedding - And having finalized your resort choice !!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You've chosen well - and will have a gorgeous backdrop for your wedding images - as you can see in these magical wedding moments that matter we captured there......great choice!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>.....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152285887359487.1073741881.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>NOW Sapphire Wedding Album 1:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10012197_10152285889364487_524506458_o.jpg\" alt=\"10012197_10152285889364487_524506458_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/1559314_10152285890684487_253307493_o.jpg\" alt=\"1559314_10152285890684487_253307493_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/1909431_10152285892349487_154319466_o.jpg\" alt=\"1909431_10152285892349487_154319466_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>.....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151784774734487.1073741863.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>NOW Sapphire Wedding Album 2:<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash2\/t31.0-8\/1149436_10151784776474487_1878076495_o.jpg\" alt=\"1149436_10151784776474487_1878076495_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/l\/t31.0-8\/1270475_10151784779319487_2126711578_o.jpg\" alt=\"1270475_10151784779319487_2126711578_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>WIshing you happy reserach, and that your thoroughly ENJOY your amazing journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
