     <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Went on a girls trip here starting off the New Year. We had a WONDERFUL time. The staff, pools, and food was FABULOUS!! Definitely Unlimited Luxury!! Having my wedding at the Secrets in Jamaica. Can't wait!! :cheer2:\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374614124,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72281,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee8a8e4581daf90ac57c62b18c268d5d","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;RandL2015&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n Went on a girls trip here starting off the New Year. We had a WONDERFUL time. The staff, pools, and food was FABULOUS!! Definitely Unlimited Luxury!!\n \n Having my wedding at the Secrets in Jamaica. Can&#039;t wait!! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Awesome, it&#039;s great to hear you loved it! I think we&#039;re going to go ahead and book here for 4 nights in December. Can&#039;t wait!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1799233,"PostDate":1378916163,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>RandL2015<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Went on a girls trip here starting off the New Year. We had a WONDERFUL time. The staff, pools, and food was FABULOUS!! Definitely Unlimited Luxury!!<br \/> <br \/> Having my wedding at the Secrets in Jamaica. Can't wait!! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Awesome, it's great to hear you loved it! I think we're going to go ahead and book here for 4 nights in December. Can't wait!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimberly.j.schwartz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.149.174.159","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1362608752,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266986.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ironman","Id":266986,"Name":"ironman","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72281,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f0e0bd1db4ceabfbabd1a76282ccec18","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is a beautiful resort!&amp;nbsp; Not sure why there isn&#039;t much traffic there...wedding related.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1799236,"PostDate":1378917230,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is a beautiful resort!\u00a0 Not sure why there isn't much traffic there...wedding related.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Ana_Steele58@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"97.72.227.220","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359151873,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265082.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AnaSteele58","Id":265082,"Name":"AnaSteele58","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72281,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e2b175c2d427ccfb07529443c01536a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am visiting this resort in March and hoping that the boy will like it as well for our wedding as well....it is a while down the road for us though being in 2015 :p&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1802359,"PostDate":1379998182,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am visiting this resort in March and hoping that the boy will like it as well for our wedding as well....it is a while down the road for us though being in 2015 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#00ffff;\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">*~Leslie~*<\/span><\/span><\/span> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>","Email":"ltalbott78@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.88.142.22","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1366599591,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268835.jpg?_r=1391394238","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"travelgal78","Id":268835,"Name":"travelgal78","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72281,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d46c90763c3e2dce38dbaa85f491f318","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We ended up booking STV for four nights in December. I am so excited, their trip advisor reviews have been awesome. Plus they&#039;ve been super quick to respond back to any inquiries we&#039;ve sent them, which is the total opposite of the resort we&#039;re having our wedding at. I too am surprised this resort isn&#039;t more popular for weddings yet, possible because it&#039;s adults-only?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1814801,"PostDate":1384458419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We ended up booking STV for four nights in December. I am so excited, their trip advisor reviews have been awesome. Plus they've been super quick to respond back to any inquiries we've sent them, which is the total opposite of the resort we're having our wedding at. I too am surprised this resort isn't more popular for weddings yet, possible because it's adults-only?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimberly.j.schwartz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.149.174.159","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1362608752,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266986.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ironman","Id":266986,"Name":"ironman","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":19,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
