{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68707,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6397ace63520cf675611ce45d75f63e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; How many are getting married on one resort, villa, island etc and honeymooning on another?&amp;nbsp; I am thinking of maybe going to stay at another resort after the wedding but wondering if it is worth the hassle traveling while supposed to be on honeymoon.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1645987,"PostDate":1343353503,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How many are getting married on one resort, villa, island etc and honeymooning on another?\u00a0 I am thinking of maybe going to stay at another resort after the wedding but wondering if it is worth the hassle traveling while supposed to be on honeymoon.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tyrebride2be2013@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.166.250.245","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1333146182,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253398.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tyrebride2b2013","Id":253398,"Name":"tyrebride2b2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68707,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c5ae77846056574c8fb1dd3d5e52afc7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are definitely changing resorts! We will be at the first one for a whole week so I want a change of scenery! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1646225,"PostDate":1343407186,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are definitely changing resorts! We will be at the first one for a whole week so I want a change of scenery! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"houstonnlh@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"173.11.179.100","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1339598243,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256618.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Houstonnlh","Id":256618,"Name":"Houstonnlh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68707,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c16b2cc313a5ac64d59f31e5424d5c4c","RawContent":"We plan to do the same^^^ I get bored easily.","Attachments":[],"Id":1646276,"PostDate":1343412328,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We plan to do the same^^^ I get bored easily.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lachefs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1343396162,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258457.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FranandFredo","Id":258457,"Name":"FranandFredo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68707,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2686f723787bcd11df485ff8d0a4973","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; where are you ladies getting married? are you leaving the island or just the resort?&amp;nbsp; How long are you honeymooning?\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1646381,"PostDate":1343427747,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> where are you ladies getting married? are you leaving the island or just the resort?\u00a0 How long are you honeymooning?<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tyrebride2be2013@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.166.250.245","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1333146182,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253398.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tyrebride2b2013","Id":253398,"Name":"tyrebride2b2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68707,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1aa379692f87642bf4b53d4c5dec4607","RawContent":"We are planning to be gone for two weeks! We are staying at the wedding site resort for the first week and changing resorts for the second week! The honeymoon location is about 20 min away from the first one! Mix it up mid trip! And be alone......\u00f0\u0178\u02dc\u2030","Attachments":[],"Id":1646392,"PostDate":1343431638,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are planning to be gone for two weeks! We are staying at the wedding site resort for the first week and changing resorts for the second week! The honeymoon location is about 20 min away from the first one! Mix it up mid trip! And be alone......\u00f0\u0178\u02dc\u2030\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhughes1511@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1343092954,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258252.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jenna1511","Id":258252,"Name":"Jenna1511","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68707,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"743e0570104b282d3bf46c9a01e4e6dd","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Jenna1511[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n We are planning to be gone for two weeks! We are staying at the wedding site resort for the first week and changing resorts for the second week! The honeymoon location is about 20 min away from the first one! Mix it up mid trip! And be alone......\u00f0\u0178\u02dc\u2030[\/quote] \n \n that sounds nice a whole week of vacation alone..technically first vacation as man and wife..","Attachments":[],"Id":1646583,"PostDate":1343508221,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Jenna1511<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> We are planning to be gone for two weeks! We are staying at the wedding site resort for the first week and changing resorts for the second week! The honeymoon location is about 20 min away from the first one! Mix it up mid trip! And be alone......\u00f0\u0178\u02dc\u2030<\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> that sounds nice a whole week of vacation alone..technically first vacation as man and wife..<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tyrebride2be2013@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.166.250.245","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1333146182,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253398.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tyrebride2b2013","Id":253398,"Name":"tyrebride2b2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68707,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9be952fbaf15d2e5ad6da8c004bb7297","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I read these posts of all these brides that want to honeymoon at the same location that all the guests are staying at, I think they&#039;re CRAZY. &amp;nbsp;lol. &amp;nbsp;But...to each his\/her own..I guess for them its super important to spend time with their loved ones who they probably haven&#039;t seen in a long time (I still think they&#039;re crazy, lol). &amp;nbsp;Anyway, we are staying at our wedding resort for only 1 more night after our wedding. &amp;nbsp;We arrive Tuesday, get married on Friday, and leave on Sunday morning to another resort on the same island but 2 hours away. &amp;nbsp;At that point, I&#039;ll have had enough of everyone, had a chance to spend a few days with them all, and will need to decompress from all the wedding craziness in a new surrounding. &amp;nbsp;I think that&#039;s something every bride and groom deserve!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1646732,"PostDate":1343570354,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I read these posts of all these brides that want to honeymoon at the same location that all the guests are staying at, I think they're CRAZY. \u00a0lol. \u00a0But...to each his\/her own..I guess for them its super important to spend time with their loved ones who they probably haven't seen in a long time (I still think they're crazy, lol). \u00a0Anyway, we are staying at our wedding resort for only 1 more night after our wedding. \u00a0We arrive Tuesday, get married on Friday, and leave on Sunday morning to another resort on the same island but 2 hours away. \u00a0At that point, I'll have had enough of everyone, had a chance to spend a few days with them all, and will need to decompress from all the wedding craziness in a new surrounding. \u00a0I think that's something every bride and groom deserve!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marireyes0715@aol.com","IpAddress":"204.110.170.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1304079168,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239438.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"maridr2012","Id":239438,"Name":"maridr2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68707,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7272b4fd1d481ee428401dd67544c54c","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]maridr2012[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I read these posts of all these brides that want to honeymoon at the same location that all the guests are staying at, I think they&#039;re CRAZY.  lol.  But...to each his\/her own..I guess for them its super important to spend time with their loved ones who they probably haven&#039;t seen in a long time (I still think they&#039;re crazy, lol).  Anyway, we are staying at our wedding resort for only 1 more night after our wedding.  We arrive Tuesday, get married on Friday, and leave on Sunday morning to another resort on the same island but 2 hours away.  At that point, I&#039;ll have had enough of everyone, had a chance to spend a few days with them all, and will need to decompress from all the wedding craziness in a new surrounding.  I think that&#039;s something every bride and groom deserve! \n \n Good luck![\/quote] \n \n lol.that&#039;s my issue not to sure that I want to be around family after wedding for the entire honeymoon.  I mean love my family and friends but it&#039;s supposed to be my honeymoon not a family vacation.  I think I am going  to see how long all the guests book before I decide.  FI is one of those people though who wants to be around family and friends","Attachments":[],"Id":1646828,"PostDate":1343593830,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>maridr2012<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I read these posts of all these brides that want to honeymoon at the same location that all the guests are staying at, I think they're CRAZY. \u00a0lol. \u00a0But...to each his\/her own..I guess for them its super important to spend time with their loved ones who they probably haven't seen in a long time (I still think they're crazy, lol). \u00a0Anyway, we are staying at our wedding resort for only 1 more night after our wedding. \u00a0We arrive Tuesday, get married on Friday, and leave on Sunday morning to another resort on the same island but 2 hours away. \u00a0At that point, I'll have had enough of everyone, had a chance to spend a few days with them all, and will need to decompress from all the wedding craziness in a new surrounding. \u00a0I think that's something every bride and groom deserve!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Good luck!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> lol.that's my issue not to sure that I want to be around family after wedding for the entire honeymoon. \u00a0I mean love my family and friends but it's supposed to be my honeymoon not a family vacation. \u00a0I think I am going \u00a0to see how long all the guests book before I decide. \u00a0FI is one of those people though who wants to be around family and friends<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tyrebride2be2013@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.166.250.245","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1333146182,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253398.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tyrebride2b2013","Id":253398,"Name":"tyrebride2b2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68707,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6cb6e323a21298ebc19335aa4bc9314","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]tyrebride2b2013[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n lol.that&#039;s my issue not to sure that I want to be around family after wedding for the entire honeymoon.  I mean love my family and friends but it&#039;s supposed to be my honeymoon not a family vacation.  I think I am going  to see how long all the guests book before I decide.  FI is one of those people though who wants to be around family and friends[\/quote] \n Ha!  Mine is too!  My FI is APPALLED that I don&#039;t want to spend the entire week and then some with his fam n our friends.  I had to negotiate with him on it.  But, ultimately it came down to this:  he travels so much, average 2 wks each month.  I kinda sugar talked him by explaining we never get to spend quality time just by ourselves, and this will be the only opportunity before we have kids (umm like next year) when we&#039;ll be able to enjoy each other&#039;s company by ourselves in a beautiful location as husband and wife.  He got it, understood and relented.  Good luck with your plans : )","Attachments":[],"Id":1646850,"PostDate":1343597288,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>tyrebride2b2013<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> lol.that's my issue not to sure that I want to be around family after wedding for the entire honeymoon. \u00a0I mean love my family and friends but it's supposed to be my honeymoon not a family vacation. \u00a0I think I am going \u00a0to see how long all the guests book before I decide. \u00a0FI is one of those people though who wants to be around family and friends<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Ha! \u00a0Mine is too! \u00a0My FI is APPALLED that I don't want to spend the entire week and then some with his fam n our friends. \u00a0I had to negotiate with him on it. \u00a0But, ultimately it came down to this: \u00a0he travels so much, average 2 wks each month. \u00a0I kinda sugar talked him by explaining we never get to spend quality time just by ourselves, and this will be the only opportunity before we have kids (umm like next year) when we'll be able to enjoy each other's company by ourselves in a beautiful location as husband and wife. \u00a0He got it, understood and relented. \u00a0Good luck with your plans : )<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marireyes0715@aol.com","IpAddress":"204.110.170.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1304079168,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239438.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"maridr2012","Id":239438,"Name":"maridr2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68707,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8302cff3486d7a380c9004faadf1dff","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]maridr2012[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Ha!  Mine is too!  My FI is APPALLED that I don&#039;t want to spend the entire week and then some with his fam n our friends.  I had to negotiate with him on it.  But, ultimately it came down to this:  he travels so much, average 2 wks each month.  I kinda sugar talked him by explaining we never get to spend quality time just by ourselves, and this will be the only opportunity before we have kids (umm like next year) when we&#039;ll be able to enjoy each other&#039;s company by ourselves in a beautiful location as husband and wife.  He got it, understood and relented.  Good luck with your plans : )[\/quote] \n hahaahhah!! So I see both of our FI&#039;s feel the same way.  I am going to have to sugar talk him into the same.  We already have children and they are actually leaving 2days after the wedding and traveling back with family so he should really understand the fact that we need to have our honeymoon alone.  I mean how is it that we are getting a children break and being stuck with family and friends.","Attachments":[],"Id":1646852,"PostDate":1343597791,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>maridr2012<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Ha! \u00a0Mine is too! \u00a0My FI is APPALLED that I don't want to spend the entire week and then some with his fam n our friends. \u00a0I had to negotiate with him on it. \u00a0But, ultimately it came down to this: \u00a0he travels so much, average 2 wks each month. \u00a0I kinda sugar talked him by explaining we never get to spend quality time just by ourselves, and this will be the only opportunity before we have kids (umm like next year) when we'll be able to enjoy each other's company by ourselves in a beautiful location as husband and wife. \u00a0He got it, understood and relented. \u00a0Good luck with your plans : )<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> hahaahhah!! So I see both of our FI's feel the same way. \u00a0I am going to have to sugar talk him into the same. \u00a0We already have children and they are actually leaving 2days after the wedding and traveling back with family so he should really understand the fact that we need to have our honeymoon alone. \u00a0I mean how is it that we are getting a children break and being stuck with family and friends.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tyrebride2be2013@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.166.250.245","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1333146182,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253398.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tyrebride2b2013","Id":253398,"Name":"tyrebride2b2013","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":37,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
